                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNG UND VERFAHREN ZUR BEREITSTELLUNG VON VISUELLEM WAHRNEHMUNGSTRAINING UNTER VERWENDUNG VON VISUELLEM WAHRNEHMUNGSLERNEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF ET PROCÉDÉ POUR FOURNIR UN APPRENTISSAGE DE PERCEPTION VISUELLE À L'AIDE D'UN APPRENTISSAGE DE PERCEPTION VISUELLE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DEVICE AND METHOD FOR PROVIDING VISUAL PERCEPTION TRAINING USING VISUAL PERCEPTION LEARNING</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a device for providing visual perception training to improve visual ability by using visual perception learning, the device comprising: a display module; and a controller for acquiring at least one target area corresponding to at least one of a first cell of a left eye visual field map and a second cell of a right eye visual field map, and providing a visual perception task to the at least one target area, wherein, in the providing of the visual perception task, the controller displays, through the display module, a task object for reception of a patient's response and central fixation of a visual field of the patient, displays at least one stimulation object in at least one stimulation position corresponding to the at least one target area through the display module, and acquires the patient's response related to the task object.</p>
            </abstract>
